{"audio": "romans-16.opus", "duration_ms": 178994, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2080, "end_ms": 3460, "text": "Romans, Chapter Sixteen."}, {"start_ms": 4780, "end_ms": 8561, "text": "I commend to you our sister Phoebe, a servant of the church in Cenchrea."}, {"start_ms": 9201, "end_ms": 14701, "text": "Welcome her in the Lord in a manner worthy of the saints, and assist her with anything she may need from you."}, {"start_ms": 15121, "end_ms": 17961, "text": "For she has been a great help to many people, including me."}, {"start_ms": 18741, "end_ms": 24262, "text": "Greet Prisca and Aquila, my fellow workers in Christ Jesus, who have risked their lives for me."}, {"start_ms": 24722, "end_ms": 28262, "text": "Not only I but all the churches of the Gentiles are grateful to them."}, {"start_ms": 29062, "end_ms": 31242, "text": "Greet also the church that meets at their house."}, {"start_ms": 32003, "end_ms": 36583, "text": "Greet my beloved Epenetus, who was the first convert to Christ in the province of Asia."}, {"start_ms": 37403, "end_ms": 39483, "text": "Greet Mary, who has worked very hard for you."}, {"start_ms": 40443, "end_ms": 44643, "text": "Greet Andronicus and Junia, my fellow countrymen and fellow prisoners."}, {"start_ms": 45124, "end_ms": 49344, "text": "They are outstanding among the apostles, and they were in Christ before I was."}, {"start_ms": 49924, "end_ms": 52244, "text": "Greet Ampliatus, my beloved in the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 52704, "end_ms": 56484, "text": "Greet Urbanus, our fellow worker in Christ, and my beloved Stachys."}, {"start_ms": 57064, "end_ms": 59245, "text": "Greet Apelles, who is approved in Christ."}, {"start_ms": 59845, "end_ms": 62645, "text": "Greet those who belong to the household of Aristobulus."}, {"start_ms": 63205, "end_ms": 65065, "text": "Greet Herodion, my fellow countryman."}, {"start_ms": 65585, "end_ms": 68605, "text": "Greet those from the household of Narcissus who are in the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 69025, "end_ms": 72826, "text": "Greet Tryphena and Tryphosa, women who have worked hard in the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 73426, "end_ms": 76406, "text": "Greet my beloved Persis, who has worked very hard in the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 77046, "end_ms": 81366, "text": "Greet Rufus, chosen in the Lord, and his mother, who has been a mother to me as well."}, {"start_ms": 82226, "end_ms": 87747, "text": "Greet Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas, and the brothers with them."}, {"start_ms": 88727, "end_ms": 94547, "text": "Greet Philologus and Julia, Nereus and his sister, and Olympas and all the saints with them."}, {"start_ms": 95127, "end_ms": 96788, "text": "Greet one another with a holy kiss."}, {"start_ms": 97508, "end_ms": 99908, "text": "All the churches of Christ send you greetings."}, {"start_ms": 101088, "end_ms": 107868, "text": "Now I urge you, brothers, to watch out for those who create divisions and obstacles that are contrary to the teaching you have learned."}, {"start_ms": 108468, "end_ms": 109329, "text": "Turn away from them."}, {"start_ms": 109769, "end_ms": 113869, "text": "For such people are not serving our Lord Christ, but their own appetites."}, {"start_ms": 114249, "end_ms": 117769, "text": "By smooth talk and flattery they deceive the hearts of the naive."}, {"start_ms": 118309, "end_ms": 121610, "text": "Everyone has heard about your obedience, so I rejoice over you."}, {"start_ms": 122070, "end_ms": 126090, "text": "But I want you to be wise about what is good and innocent about what is evil."}, {"start_ms": 126870, "end_ms": 129830, "text": "The God of peace will soon crush Satan under your feet."}, {"start_ms": 130370, "end_ms": 132690, "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you."}, {"start_ms": 133830, "end_ms": 139911, "text": "Timothy, my fellow worker, sends you greetings, as do Lucius, Jason, and Sosipater, my fellow countrymen."}, {"start_ms": 141091, "end_ms": 143951, "text": "I, Tertius, who wrote down this letter, greet you in the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 144371, "end_ms": 147632, "text": "Gaius, who has hosted me and all the church, sends you greetings."}, {"start_ms": 148212, "end_ms": 152272, "text": "Erastus, the city treasurer, sends you greetings, as does our brother Quartus."}, {"start_ms": 153492, "end_ms": 158392, "text": "Now to Him who is able to strengthen you by my gospel and by the proclamation of Jesus Christ,"}, {"start_ms": 158792, "end_ms": 167913, "text": "according to the revelation of the mystery concealed for ages past but now revealed and made known through the writings of the prophets by the command of the eternal God,"}, {"start_ms": 168393, "end_ms": 176034, "text": "in order to lead all nations to the obedience that comes from faith— to the only wise God be glory forever through Jesus Christ!"}, {"start_ms": 176814, "end_ms": 177194, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "Romans,", "s": 2080, "e": 2480, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2600, "e": 2900, "si": 0}, {"t": "Sixteen.", "s": 2980, "e": 3460, "si": 0}, {"t": "I", "s": 4780, "e": 4800, "si": 1}, {"t": "commend", "s": 4860, "e": 5180, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 5220, "e": 5280, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 5320, "e": 5420, "si": 1}, {"t": "our", "s": 5500, "e": 5580, "si": 1}, {"t": "sister", "s": 5680, "e": 5980, "si": 1}, {"t": "Phoebe,", "s": 6040, "e": 6320, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 6661, "e": 6681, "si": 1}, {"t": "servant", "s": 6781, "e": 7141, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 7201, "e": 7281, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 7301, "e": 7381, "si": 1}, {"t": "church", "s": 7441, "e": 7761, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 7841, "e": 7941, "si": 1}, {"t": "Cenchrea.", "s": 8101, "e": 8561, "si": 1}, {"t": "Welcome", "s": 9201, "e": 9561, "si": 2}, {"t": "her", "s": 9581, "e": 9701, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 9761, "e": 9821, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 9861, "e": 9921, "si": 2}, {"t": "Lord", "s": 9981, "e": 10241, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 10401, "e": 10481, "si": 2}, {"t": "a", "s": 10521, "e": 10541, "si": 2}, {"t": "mann